ts techniques... but what he's really going to learn about are some slightly more practical things, like electrical appliances, modern clothing and, most especially, how NOT to make girls want to kill you!\n\nUnfortunately, that last lesson is one Yoichi may not survive, as his new dojo is infested with the infernal creatures in the form of the Ikaruga sisters, and they don't really seem to understand how \"proper\" girls are \"supposed\" to behave! Will Yoichi's bushido blade be struck down by the fearsome charms of Ibuki, Ayame, Chihaya, and Kagome? Or will the equally lethal girls from the rival Tsubame school be his undoing?\n\n(Source: RightStuf)"},"tags":[{"name":"Female Harem","rank":87,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Martial Arts","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Samurai","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cohabitation","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Achromatic","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bowling","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Samurai Harem","english":"Samurai Harem","native":"明日のよいち！","romaji":"Asu no Yoichi!","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"明日的与一"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"神劍好小子"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"道場4+1"}]},"trailer":{"id":"Nw3K2Frc8nU","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Nw3K2Frc8nU/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}